text:
indexing and event streams

Our product is already running. We're using Public tools from some of the teams below

Now I wanna talk to the teams directly. see what we can improve, what else we can do with their infra and who to reach when something weird comes up.

Here's what we're looking at:

@goldskyio: event streams, protocol indexing

@graphprotocol: subgraphs, contract data, event history

@envio_indexer: custom indexing, fast data processing.

@AlliumLabs: cross-chain data, API, live updates

@goldrushdev: balances, tx history, decoded events

@Helius: Solana data, streams, notifications

@helloSQD: historical data, custom indexing tools.

no single provider covers everything. that's fine. each of these teams has something we're interested in

And there's probably more we can do together than what’s in the public docs.

Maybe one provider can cover a few things we're handling separately right now We've got some use cases they might find interesting too.

We're open to direct partnerships. Got a working product and specific things we wanna discuss.

Know someone on these teams? Intro us.😺

Building similar infra? Hit me up too. We can swap docs, go through the details and talk integrations.

